WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.720
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and since Winter
Soldier is getting ready to premiere I thought

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.320
it would be fun to talk about other big Captain
America stories they could do for the third

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.320
movie in phase 3.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.040
Right now Marvel hasn’t announced a release
date but they have hired the same directors

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.860
from Winter Soldier to start developing the
movie.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.359
There’s been a lot of big Marvel news this
week with the new Guardians of the Galaxy

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:24.189
Trailer so in case you missed it I’m bookmarking
Tuesday’s as like a permanent Marvel Video

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:25.609
Day.

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:28.599
Be sure to subscribe to get everything!

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:31.710
The story of Captain America 3 will have to
tie in with all the other films happening

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:37.040
in Phase 3 like Ant-Man, Thor 3 and Avengers
3 but here are the top 5 Captain America comic

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.969
book stories they could use.

00:00:38.969 --> 00:00:40.820
Number 5 - Dimension Z written by Rick Remender.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.320
It more of a science fiction based story that
involves this alternate dimension plot that’s

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.429
a little bizzare, but Kevin Fiege said that
Phase 3 is all about Magic and that opens

00:00:48.429 --> 00:00:49.570
the door to the Multiverse.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:54.190
Another big part of the story is Cap raising
Arnim Zola’s son as his own and even being

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:56.089
possessed by Zola for a little while.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:01:00.079
Minus the multiverse aspect of the story,
they could totally use Red Skull’s daughter

00:01:00.079 --> 00:01:02.000
Sin or Zola’s son in a new movie.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.570
Marvel even based their Fear Itself comic
book on Sin.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.300
Number 4 - Operation Rebirth.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.130
Captain America is forced to work with The
Red Skull to defeat Hitler.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:17.240
In the comic, Hitler’s consciousness was
trapped in the cosmic cube or tesseract as

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.510
it’s called in the movies.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.860
So based on the events of the first Captain
America movie, they’d probably swap Hitler

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.410
for the Red Skull.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:26.180
And swap the Red Skull for another villain
like Arnim Zola.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:29.690
There are a lot of rumors that The Red Skull
is going to be in Winter Soldier, but pending

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:33.240
that we still don’t know what happened to
him after he got sucked into the tesseract

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:38.500
in the first movie, so the character is still
alive until proven otherwise.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.610
Number 3 - Crossbones and Sin.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:42.670
Captain America VS The Red Skull’s Daughter.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:47.120
This story is all about how Crossbones played
by Frank Grillo in Winter Soldier tracks down

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.580
the Red Skull’s daughter Sin and the two
wreak havoc for Captain America.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:55.931
There is a big rumor that Emily Van Camp is
secretly playing Sin in Winter Soldier, but

00:01:55.931 --> 00:01:59.810
using the Sin character would give a third
movie a way to bring the Red Skull back full

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:00.810
circle.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:04.870
Plus we’re already confirmed to see Crossbones
so most of the characters will have already

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.250
appeared in a Marvel movie.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.640
Number 2 - The Death of Captain America.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.220
This would have to be tweaked just a little
because it heavily involves Iron Man and Robert

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:15.780
Downey Jr only has a contract to appear in
Avengers 2 and 3 right now.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.620
So using him again would be extremely expensive.

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.280
But they could substitute that character for
another hero.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:25.250
It was the climax of the Civil War storyline
and would be a good story for Chris Evans

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.400
to leave the franchise on, based on what happens
to Captain America at the end of the story.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.810
But since Evans is signed for at least 3 or
4 more movies, he’ll be around for a long

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.160
time.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:40.350
And Number ` - Captain America Reborn.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:44.380
This involves the resolution of the Death
of Captain America story and the Sharon Carter

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.380
character.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:49.280
Since she’s being played by Emily Van Camp
in Winter Soldier we might get a few teases

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.380
from these storylines.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.540
But Reborn is all about him coming back from
the dead with this supernatural Red Skull

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.800
body possession plot.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:01.520
It’s very magical slash metaphysical, so
it would fit with the tone of phase 3 maybe

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.960
after a Doctor Strange movie.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.880
And one last Bonus Option - Avengers Under
Seige.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:10.690
This is all about Baron Zemo and the Masters
of Evil storming the Avengers Mansion and

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.160
beating everyone within an inch of their life.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:17.440
They crush Cap’s spirit by destroying all
his World War II mementos from before he got

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.700
the Super Soldier Serum.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.440
It’s just villains twisting the knife in
his wounds.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:25.280
You’d have to substitute some of the Avengers
for other characters, but Winter Soldier is

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.150
already playing with this theme a little as
the villains injure Nick Fury pretty badly

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.340
in the movie.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:34.790
There are a bunch of other possibilities for
them to pick from but remember that all of

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:39.819
Marvel’s Phase 3 movies thematically have
to blend well with the idea of Magic and tie

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:44.340
into the Infinity Guantlet storyline for Avengers
3 purposes.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.569
Just picture Captain America in outer space.

00:03:46.569 --> 00:03:52.370
The real trick is integrating the more cosmic
elements of the Marvel Universe into the more

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.120
practical aspects of the Captain America character.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:59.290
So let me know which other stories you’d
like to see them do for Captain America 3

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.130
and do you think Red Skull will show up in
Winter Soldier?

